><span begin="00:25.990" end="00:26.020">, </span><span begin="00:26.020" end="00:26.470">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.560" end="00:31.060"><span begin="00:26.560" end="00:27.190">I'm </span><span begin="00:27.190" end="00:27.670">never </span><span begin="00:27.670" end="00:28.240">comin' </span><span begin="00:28.240" end="00:28.690">back</span><span begin="00:28.690" end="00:28.690">, </span><span begin="00:28.690" end="00:29.110">never </span><span begin="00:29.110" end="00:29.710">comin' </span><span begin="00:29.710" end="00:31.060">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.120" end="00:33.910"><span begin="00:31.120" end="00:32.200">Lungs </span><span begin="00:32.200" end="00:32.620">filled </span><span begin="00:32.620" end="00:32.710">with </span><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:33.910">smoke</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.000" end="00:37.600"><span begin="00:34.000" end="00:34.390">Lead </span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.480">in </span><span begin="00:34.480" end="00:34.930">my </span><span begin="00:34.930" end="00:35.980">head</span><span begin="00:35.980" end="00:36.010">, </span><span begin="00:36.010" end="00:36.550">filled </span><span begin="00:36.550" end="00:36.670">with </span><span begin="00:36.670" end="00:37.600">dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.690" end="00:41.980"><span begin="00:37.690" end="00:37.930">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.930" end="00:38.470">hidin' </span><span begin="00:38.470" end="00:38.710">here </span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:38.830">to </span><span begin="00:38.830" end="00:39.430">live </span><span begin="00:39.430" end="00:40.390">in </span><span begin="00:40.390" end="00:41.440">sleep</span><span begin="00:41.440" end="00:41.470">, </span><span begin="00:41.470" end="00:41.980">hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.040" end="00:46.840"><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:42.640">I'm </span><span begin="00:42.640" end="00:43.150">never </span><span begin="00:43.